        "text": "Ms Adeyemi signed a registration card at reception that recorded basic details but contained no terms or conditions",
        "citations": [
          "F2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A notice on the back of the bedroom door excluded liability for loss or damage to guests' property and required valuables to be deposited at reception",
