          "F3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The same exclusion terms appeared on the hotel's website, which Ms Adeyemi had never visited",
        "citations": [
          "F4"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On 13 August 2025, Ms Adeyemi's laptop and diamond bracelet worth \u00a36,500 were stolen from her room without forced entry; a member of staff had left a master key unattended on a cleaning trolley",
        "citations": [
          "F5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The hotel relies on the bedroom door notice to exclude liability and argues Ms Adeyemi should have deposited valuables at reception",
        "citations": [
          "F6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ms Adeyemi seeks to recover the value of her stolen property and argues the exclusion notice is not part of her contract with the hotel",
        "citations": [
          "F7"
        ]
      }
    ],
